id: zw_log
label: Z-Wave Log
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  This component implements logging via the ZPAL Log API.

  Logging can be enabled or disabled per software component and log level
  (Debug, Info, Warning, Error).
  Each log level can be directed to a different output channel via the iostream
  driver (e.g. UART, RTT, SWO, etc.).

  A generic macro, ZPAL_LOG_PRINT, is available for ad-hoc debugging.
  This has the same syntax as printf and its output is directed to the Debug
  channel.

  Most pre-defined log messages belonging to software components are disabled by
  default to conserve flash space.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license
requires:
- name: iostream_eusart
  condition: [zaf_soc]
- name: iostream_swo
  condition: [zaf_ncp]
provides:
- name: zw_log

include:
- path: ZAF/ApplicationUtilities
  file_list:
  - path: ZAF_PrintAppInfo.h
source:
- path: platform/SiliconLabs/components/zw_log/zw_log.c
- path: ZAF/ApplicationUtilities/ZAF_PrintAppInfo.c
config_file:
- path: sample_apps/config/zw_log/zw_log_config.h
  file_id: zw_log_config
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: zw_log
root_path: zwave
